# Support Ticket Management System

A full-stack Support Ticket Management System built with **FastAPI, PostgreSQL, SQLAlchemy, Alembic, React, and TypeScript**.

The system provides role-based access control for **Admins, Support Agents, and Customers**, along with ticket management, assignment, status workflows, comments, attachments, notifications, SLA tracking, dashboards, and audit logging.

