# Project Overview

The Support Ticket Management System is designed to manage customer support requests through a centralized ticketing platform.

Customers can create and track their support tickets.

Support Agents can view assigned tickets, update ticket status, communicate with customers, and manage ticket resolution.

Administrators have complete control over users, tickets, categories, assignments, audit logs, and system-level operations.

